    "text": "hoodline.com\nwebsite\nCovington\nCovington Commuters Detour as Crews Remove Hazardous Tree from Shelton Park\nBy Caleb Powell,\n9 hours agoCommuters in Covington, Tennessee faced a slight disruption this morning as work crews took to Shelton Park, undertaking the task of removing a tree that posed a traffic hazard. The Covington Tennessee Police Department alerted the public via social media, advising that Church Street would temporarily be closed between Hwy 51 and A. College Street. Traffic, as well as daily routines, were expected to detour around the heart of this small city until noon.",
